From 7a204b9fb26e4037919984bc38a73f3dae889003 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 20 Jun 2026 08:07:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 08/14] chore(pipeline): r180 image bringup snapshot
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bundle of pre-existing local divergence from postmarketos/duranium that
the r180 HackberryPi CM5 image depends on. Captured as one snapshot so
Marathon-Image's pipeline-patches/ can reproduce the working build
from a clean upstream-duranium clone.

* .gitignore — exclude mkosi.extra paths that carry secrets
  (NetworkManager keyfile + SSH authorized_keys, populated from
  ~/.marathon-secrets/ at build time).
* mkosi.conf — force FAT16 (Pi 5 BootROM EEPROMs reject FAT32) +
  pmOS_boot/pmOS_root FS labels for blkid discovery; binutils in the
  tools tree for objcopy UKI section extraction.
* mkosi.images/base/mkosi.conf — postmarketos-base-nofde (replaces
  unl0kr conflict), postmarketos-duranium-initramfs (understands
  composefs + /usr-only layout), wireless-regdb, wireplumber-logind,
  pipewire-spa-bluez, linux-rpi pinned to 6.12.85 (6.18.35 has a Pi 5
  initrd NULL-deref).
* mkosi.images/base/mkosi.postinst — user .ssh tmpfiles, factory
  Marathon Shell.conf with firstRunComplete=false +
  userScaleFactor=1.10, /etc/pam.d/base-{auth,session} overrides that
  drop pam_gnome_keyring / pam_kwallet5 (we ship neither daemon).
* mkosi.repart — pmOS_boot label on ESP, delete the /usr-verity +
  /usr-only partitions, add a single-root 11-root.conf (5G ext4 with
  pmOS_root label).
* scripts/build-image.py — post-mkosi Pi 5 MBR fixup: wipe GPT
  primary+backup headers, sfdisk a clean MBR (FAT16 LBA bootable +
  Linux 0x83). Pi 5 BootROM doesn't honour GPT — see
  [[duranium-pi5-boot-recipe]] memory.
* scripts/pmaports.py — qemu-aarch64 kernel override to
  kernel-stable (LTS 6.18.35 has a regression); deviceinfo walker
  that follows marathon-overlay depends to inherit deviceinfo from
  upstream base device pkgs.
* marathon-extras/build-marathon-shell-apk.sh — patchelf in the
  build container (needed for RPATH stripping during install).
* marathon-extras/build-and-boot-phaseB.sh — BUILD_FOR_SD=1 skips the
  20G qemu pad (SD-card flashes don't need it).
* marathon-extras/dtbos/ — vendored hackberrypi + hyperpixel4sq
  DTBs (also baked into mkosi.extra for in-image runtime use).
* mkosi.extra/{boot/loader,etc/kernel,usr/share/marathon-dtbos} —
  loader.conf timeout, kernel install.conf layout=bls (pmOS edge
  ships it commented out, which breaks systemd-kernel-install's
  90-loaderentry hook).
* mkosi.images/base/mkosi.skeleton — in-pmbootstrap marker for the
  build chroot + per-image kernel install.conf.

Excluded from this snapshot:
* mkosi.packages/  - 383 MB of built APKs (gitignored already).
* mkosi.repart/.verity-disabled/ - backup of the deleted configs.
* mkosi.extra/etc/NetworkManager/system-connections/*.nmconnection -
  WiFi credentials, gitignored, repopulated from ~/.marathon-secrets/.
* mkosi.extra/usr/share/factory/home/user/.ssh/authorized_keys - SSH
  pubkey, gitignored, repopulated from ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub.
* marathon-extras/StoreApp.qml - unrelated UI icon-name refactor.
* marathon-extras/repack-r123.sh - ad-hoc per-build helper.
